    {
      "id": "9e9782c2-18a4-4b14-ad78-2c98182b3fcf",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Consecutive Terms",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c89fd5e7-3abf-429c-af52-6f64e5cf6972",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Since 98.01 and 98.02 involve team projects and the project from 98.01 continues into 98.02, these two courses must be taken in consecutive terms. If a student is not able to do 98.02 in the term immediately after their 98.01, the department asks that the student repeat 98.01 and then take 98.02. In extenuating circumstances, the student can petition the department for an exception. The petition should be addressed to Undergraduate Adviser listed on ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://web.cs.dartmouth.edu/undergraduate/advice",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "this page",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " and should clearly describe why the student believes they deserve an exception.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d24b920c-18a4-4e3b-944b-8f1113e27e7e",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Undergraduate Adviser will share the petition with a department faculty committee that will make the final determination.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "5862e5d0-a958-44e7-a83e-c41ba484563d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1e0fca39-a817-4243-a337-72524a83fa1e",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Wellness",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "11713780-e532-4f21-aea0-f83dae0a9804",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We recognize that the academic environment at Dartmouth is challenging, that our terms are intensive, and that classes are not the only demanding part of your life. There are a number of resources available to you on campus to support your wellness, including: your ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "http://www.dartmouth.edu/~upperde/",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "undergraduate dean",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "http://www.dartmouth.edu/~chd/",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Counseling and Human Development",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", and the ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "http://www.dartmouth.edu/~healthed/",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Student Wellness Center",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". I encourage you to use these resources and come speak with me to take care of yourself throughout the term.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "e77667a5-9cbf-415f-bbdb-c6570abf697b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "4eb3ce59-389f-4a9d-bb6f-2041045aa40b",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Accommodations",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "5377e740-9c67-4a3e-8ac0-5bceaca68633",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Students requesting disability-related accommodations and services for this course are required to register with Student Accessibility Services (SAS; ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://students.dartmouth.edu/student-accessibility/students/working-sas/getting-started",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Getting Started with SAS webpage",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "; ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "mailto:student.accessibility.services@dartmouth.edu",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "student.accessibility.services@dartmouth.edu",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "; 1-603-646-9900) and to request that an accommodation email be sent to me in advance of the need for an accommodation. Then, students should schedule a follow-up meeting with me to determine relevant details such as what role SAS or its ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://students.dartmouth.edu/student-accessibility/services/testing-center",
          "content": [
            {
